Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:47.28,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,The engine stopped ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:48.53,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,What about the sub-engine ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:51.54,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Not good. No response.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:53.46,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare for emergency landing !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:55.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Water landing in four…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:56.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,…three…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:57.48,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,…two…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:01:58.43,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,…one…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:01:59.11,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Landing !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:35.06,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Sorry, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:50.71,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Klaus Keyman… \NI wonder who he really is{after all} ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:56.92,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The ambassador who invited Kodai to the\N Moon must have been a conspirator all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:03:02.42,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}But it didn't seem like Keyman\N was expecting Desler to be here.{ the appearance of Desler.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:05.94,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why did he get on board the Yamato…?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:11.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:15.65,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I can't let the Earthlings obtain the power of Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:20.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's why I came along with them,\N and disabled the Yamato when the time was right…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:24.90,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Bring the power of Telezart to Garmillas…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:31.45,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,…for the sake of those who oppose democracy \Nand wish for the restoration of the Desler regime…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:43.86,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Mr. Mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.15,0:03:47.08,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,It sounded chaotic outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:52.26,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Well, a faithless rat was trying\N to snatch the Emperor's treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:55.18,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I killed him and took it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:04:00.63,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Telezart is currently under my fleet's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:06.60,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The door is open,\N so why don't you see for yourself ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:10.38,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Your job is to observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:15.30,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Afterwards I want to begin\N negotiations with Emperor Zorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:22.28,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I'll humbly hand over \NTelezart to the Emperor, but in return…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:32.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll agree to negotiate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:37.02,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Emperor Zorder isn't concerned about saving face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:44.59,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Given the risk of losing Teresa by \Nattacking us, he'll accept my condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:50.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Discovery or creation of a \Nplanet for Garmillans to survive…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:54.05,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Perhaps Gatlantis can…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:57.99,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Ranhalt.{Ranhart}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:04:58.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Sir ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:01.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What was that ship like ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:07.23,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,A strange ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,And the crew is just as eccentric.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:13.57,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,They looked more like pilgrims than soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:19.77,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Pilgrims, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:24.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(960,1036)}Planet Garmillas
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:28.90,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,His Highness, Ranhalt{Ranhart}, has reached Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:31.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,He has a lineage of strong luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:34.23,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,So, does Teresa exist ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.23,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:42.32,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Gatlantis occupational force has been wiped out, and Telezart is under our fleet's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:46.19,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Our fleet ? Of whom ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.77,0:05:49.70,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Of His Excellency Abelt Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:52.90,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,H...he's alive ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:06:01.80,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Desler faction's mastermind has\N been kept secret for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:04.85,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I don't know the person's identity either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:12.39,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,He'll have to come forward and talk face\N to face with me under the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:17.22,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Your Excellency, we have an incoming\N message from the home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:21.96,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,You are…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:23.96,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Ghale Desler !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:26.92,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Your Excellency, I'm glad you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:31.67,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were alive, Gimlay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:38.15,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}"The dictator who lost his mind and tried to destroy the Yamato by sacrificing the capital Ballerus…"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:42.74,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}That's how the democratic faction \Nportrays you, in order to undermine you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:51.32,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}But I know it was unavoidable in\N order to save both Garmillas and Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:57.88,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Ballerus Tower is the blade pointed at Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:04.14,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{cosmo}Those who tried to save Garmillas from \Nextinction by stealing the Cosmo Reverse...{ developed…}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:08.23,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{soutou}…developed a massive weapon without your knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:11.69,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{gun}The military betrayed you,\N but you out-smarted them…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:20.92,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{karera}…and used the Yamato's advancement to separate the core ship, which powered the weapon, from the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:27.21,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Then, to eliminate the traitors{betrayers}, the second Ballerus was…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:33.56,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Everything was for Garmillas'\N survival and Iscandar's peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:39.88,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Only a dictator's authoritarianism\N can open the future for Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.53,0:07:49.30,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{soutou}I thought Ranhalt{Ranhart} would be the only one who could \Nbear the burden of the Führer, but since you are alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:50.55,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Ranhalt.{Ranhart}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:51.38,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:53.86,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,You don't mind me taking the role ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:55.66,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:08:00.71,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We must inform all Garmillas' citizens\N of Führer Desler's return at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:06.74,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}A revolt has already been prepared. \NPlease return as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:26.57,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,They're like vultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:32.10,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,In short, it's not a mechanical malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.89,0:08:40.28,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,I don't know the cause, but the wave motion engine has some kind of critical problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.51,0:09:00.54,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Strange…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:06.26,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Tsurumi's body is right there, but he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.85,0:09:09.64,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Where have you gone ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:28.28,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Teresa…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.93,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.23,0:09:43.97,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The preparations are complete,\N and I know what to do, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:51.16,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Teresa, if you can see beyond time,\N I want you to tell me what's best !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:53.16,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Which path should I take ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:11.73,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Everything you felt on the Yamato is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:17.55,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}What makes it the best depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:23.83,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Instead of thoughts, let your feelings guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.46,0:10:28.22,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You are a part of the great harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:31.87,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Great harmony...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.60,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What are you doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.31,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Führer…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:47.06,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,How awkward…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:51.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,That's the title you wished to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:11:03.63,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,If Teresa could be taken away from here, I'd have to suspect you of betrayal, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:07.33,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,And you ?\N What're you trying to do all by yourself ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.00,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Probably the same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:13.10,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Everyone has a mental pillar of support…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:18.18,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,…especially those who can only depend on themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:22.06,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,But my support…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:32.45,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,In order to move Garmillas' citizens, I was \Ngoing to completely terraform a planet, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:36.20,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{kanojo}…she offered a helping hand to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:40.68,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,To save Iscandar, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.75,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The Cosmo Reverse is not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:50.99,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Unlike Earth, the planet Garmillas is meant to die, so I'm not sure whether I can save it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:57.63,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I sought a new world outside our galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:59.22,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,As a result…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.15,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{omae}Well, you already know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:08.85,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What was I trying to destroy at that time…?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.71,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Führer Desler…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:19.94,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Whatever the reason, I sacrificed\Nmany, many people, and that's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:25.32,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,That sin cannot be atoned for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:34.58,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,If the people of Garmillas want\N a Desler, it should be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:36.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:41.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:52.08,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}There's always someone else in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:13:00.52,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You treasure that person more\N than anyone, including yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:06.70,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}As long as you keep that feeling,\N you deserve to lead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:12.66,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,You talk a lot about things without being asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:23.17,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Now, fate appears to be completely linked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:26.93,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Teresa…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.69,0:13:35.52,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Chief Hiss, Lieutenant Keyman just contacted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:37.52,def2,HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Did you find anything ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:41.69,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,The mastermind of the faction conspiring\N to restore the Desler regime, is…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:45.95,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{moto}…the former Secretary of the Royal Guard, Heidom Gimlay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:49.45,def2,HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Gimlay ? He's alive ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:54.70,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,I'll arrest him for the dignity of the\N Intelligence and Security Bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:02.82,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}No regrets…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.86,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Hey, you ! \NWhat's the meaning of this ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Stop, Saito !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:28.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What can I… \NWhat can we trust ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:33.83,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Nothing. There's no truth to the \Nwords from an undercover agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:35.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Undercover…?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:39.90,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Garmillas Intelligence and Security Bureau\N internal affairs division agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:43.30,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:46.23,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Let's head back to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:48.12,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,If you want to kill me, do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.18,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Revolt ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:56.45,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Ranhalt went ahead and freed the Earthlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:02.28,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Let him do as he likes, \Nsame for the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:08.66,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but it suddenly fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:09.63,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:12.63,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}...I don't know if we can celebrate this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:15.06,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You might have to issue an evacuation order.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:17.13,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,No, we'll fly with what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:19.35,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Shima, prepare for take off !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:20.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,R…roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:22.32,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Chief, is that alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.28,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Do what{as} you want !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:27.86,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Ambassador Barrel worked his\N way up in the Intelligence Bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.67,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{minshuka}He believes democracy will \Nshape the future of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:37.07,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I've been trying to identify the mysterious\N mastermind on the order of the Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.07,0:15:38.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,But you are the Desler family's…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:43.94,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's the very reason. \NI want to lead Garmillas into true democracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:49.58,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's the atonement of a man who's\N been born into a family of dictators.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:54.90,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Is that why you got on the Yamato, and guided it to Telezart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:16:03.12,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It was all to gain trust and get to the \Nmysterious mastermind, and it was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.53,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:06.58,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,…I was not expecting Desler's appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:08.52,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why didn't you go with him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.33,0:16:15.17,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Especially if the story about the \Nplanet Garmillas' end is true…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:16.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.88,0:16:20.90,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I could have taken that option, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:24.37,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,…the Goddess taught me that…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:28.59,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,…I should let my feelings guide me, rather than thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:30.68,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Message from First Officer Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:32.15,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Everyone's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.16,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Get in, quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:48.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Keyman !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:08.78,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Yamato, taking off !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.49,0:17:15.67,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Deploy the main wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.83,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,You also chose the unexpected path.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:26.66,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}You....!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:29.99,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Such impulsive action will destroy the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:33.53,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Right. I have emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:35.49,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's why I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.11,0:17:40.91,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Damn you !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:47.96,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Are you alright with that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:17:58.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,This is Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:01.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I lost Keyman's ship. \NCan you trace it on your end ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:06.02,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}After leaving the enemy vessel, it rapidly \Ndove to the sea surface. We lost the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:07.83,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Say what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:10.26,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Yamamoto is heading\N to the location to rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:16.26,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Is this it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:33.06,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I've been alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:44.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I could do anything by myself, but now…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:54.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.45,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...once again…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.83,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I'll rescue him, no matter what !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:06.82,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Over there !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:25.58,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is Yamamoto.\NI've rescued Lieutenant Keyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:26.76,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Get the med team ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:33.37,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,What ?\N What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:36.48,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Teresa…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:38.18,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Yuki, what's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:42.18,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Teresa's asking us not to forget…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.49,0:19:48.05,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Farewell, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:54.73,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,I'll return to where I belong and continue praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:20:01.96,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}It's not a fixed location,\N and I don't pray for a particular person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:06.30,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,It's unobtainable after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:14.18,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Planet and planet, time and time…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:18.11,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}…and also person and person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:23.45,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Fate brings them together to form the field of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.71,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The force that holds this universe together…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:45.28,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,What is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:47.83,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:55.56,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,This is Teresa's…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.43,0:21:04.26,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I entrust my wish to the ship of the\N great harmony and will continue praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Fate…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:39.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}…is the love of the universe…?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.27,0:21:51.14,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Well, I'm fine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:05.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We know her wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.63,0:22:09.26,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We must stop Gatlantis…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.42,0:22:14.08,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,…for the sake of all living things in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:19.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Bring us about, all ahead full !{Turn around and ahead full !}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.63,0:22:22.52,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Take the Yamato back to Earth !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:45.08,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 16
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:45.08,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(460,1038)}Farewell, Teresa! Cast Bouquets for{to} Two Deslers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:23:02.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1204,544)}Kodai {\3c&HFF0000&}Susumu:\NMori Yuki:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NAihara Yoshikazu:\NTokugawa Hikozaemon:\NShinohara Hiroki:\NYamamoto Akira:\NSawamura Sho:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:23:02.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1226,186)}Ono Da{\3c&HFF0000&}isuke\NKuwashima Houko\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NKokubun Masato\NMugihito\NHirata Daisuke\NTanaka Rie\NShikaki Yuya
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.43,0:23:11.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1158,750)}{\3c&HFF0000&}Saito Hajime:\NNakagura Shiori:\NHijikata Ryu:\NAbelt Desler:\NKlaus Keyman:\NMill:\NGharder Talan:\NLoren Barrel:\NLutz Karzet:\NHeidom Gimley:\NRedof Hiss:\NNerun Keeling:\NTall Tord:\NRogue Moram:\NTeresa:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.43,0:23:11.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1188,152)}{\3c&HFF0000&}Tochi Hiroki \NAmagai Kazusa\NIshizuka Unsho\NYamadera Koichi\NKamioya Hiroshi\NUchiyama Koki \NNakamura Kotaro \NTerasoma Masaki \NOnozuka Takashi\NMorita Junpei\NAkimoto Yosuke \NKushida Yasumichi \NFujinuma Kento\NYano Masaaki\NKanda Sayaka
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:55.78,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Sotto oyasuminasai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:55.78,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}A gentle goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:03.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Osanago no youna toiki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:03.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}You breathe like a little child
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:12.88,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsumademo soba ni iru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:12.88,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll be by your side forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:18.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Mabuta tojite
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:18.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}So close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:31.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hidamari no takeru youna yasashisa de...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:31.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}As gentle as warm sunlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:38.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Tsusumi komu yo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:38.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}...I'll embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:45.40,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Shiawase umidasu chikara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:45.40,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}The power to bring happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:59.27,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Fuwari fuwari fuwa fuwa yume no naka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:59.27,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Drifting and floating, feeling like I'm having a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:11.96,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Omoi haseru yorisoinagara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:11.96,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Cuddling up and thinking of you from afar
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:26.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsudemo waratte ite hoshii to negau
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:26.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My wish is for you to keep on smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:39.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ubu na egao tayasanu youni
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.78,0:24:39.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Never let your childlike smile disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:52.25,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itooshii hito yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:52.25,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My dearest{loved} one...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.93,0:25:21.38,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.93,0:25:22.69,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Destroy the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.69,0:25:24.94,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,At this rate, Garmillas will be destroyed !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.94,0:25:26.31,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.68,0:25:28.80,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I'm a traitor.{betrayer.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.80,0:25:33.94,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,To exterminate all lifeforms including themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.93,0:25:34.93,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 17
